{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_sesa_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_sesa_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"致命誘惑","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sesa_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"31ab829b5ec74425ba7bc1db15a210ed4f29d8496b72ae7213e7a0f2ea62852e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"關於當年的那起事故，懾砂從異客那裡，再一次得到了一條誘人的線索。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是如此破爛不堪的材料，也總是一刻不停地渴求呐喊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我在聽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，懾砂先生。又是忙了一晚上吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是你在倒垃圾啊，我還以為又是哪裡的傭兵這麼早就打起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間不會寬恕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偉大的力量需要經年累月的磨礪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"才能從痛苦與毀滅中掙脫，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，懾砂先生說話還是這麼地讓人摸不著頭腦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先不打擾了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖不是你的解藥，你也無需感激我的一時興起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這是？！這是懾砂先生用那堆廢料改出來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼三兩下的功夫！真的是太厲害了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我這條老腿可從來沒有這麼靈活過，哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是些隨手的改動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望它能幫你解決些許困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你太謙虛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是太謝謝你了，懾砂先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"懾砂先生，小心後面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心一點哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"低著頭不顧一切，是會非常危險的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"聽不懂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不過懾砂叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麵包？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！一個穿得奇奇怪怪，說話也奇奇怪怪的叔叔給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我領了兩個，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"一個給你，謝謝你幫我抓住那個偷東西的傢伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（吞嚥）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“哥倫比亞”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（把紙條藏在了麵包裡？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（說話打扮都奇奇怪怪......難道是那個傢伙？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（吞嚥）嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，向我吐露你的秘密吧，究竟是何人的引導......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"懾砂先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"您就是懾砂先生吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“您”？我又怎麼配得上如此的稱呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彌散著功利的氣息，令人不寒而慄的口音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"您說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，您是不是誤會什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫達雷爾，是一名來自哥倫比亞的商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞的商人？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那張紙條難道是某種警告？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"有人向我介紹說，懾砂先生您對源石武器的改造頗有研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我現在手上有一批......來自哥倫比亞某公司的......源石武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）不知道懾砂先生有沒有興趣......聊一聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_srgmarket"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為相比於烏薩斯令人難以忍受的一切，這裡起碼還能讓人暫作喘息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我曾經是一名罪犯！可我殺的是那些每天喝得醉醺醺的該死的搜捕隊，你知道嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我只想在這裡好好生活下去，我只想照顧好我新婚的妻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至努力讓自己不再去想那些舉報了我的人渣，不再去想那些人對我做的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"可是為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你希望我為你做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"有幾名來自烏薩斯的傭兵認出了我，我沒有承認，他們卻放火燒了我的鋪子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"王酋的人趕走了他們，但是......我知道他們已經盯上我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"所以為什麼你會來找我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼樣的目的，驅使你主動放棄了自己的權利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"權利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你，你能找到他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"可你明明自己就可以動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"不對嗎？還是說你突然間對生命充滿了某種憐憫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"因為據我所知，你在烏薩斯殺死的，可不是“一名搜捕隊員”這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"我姑且將你的行為，理解為對我的不信任和考驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你看，你很清楚你的目的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，這不是一把適合用來復仇的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以給我什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以接受一切合理的價格，甚至......有趣的條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我可以幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，我只是想找一個目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"目的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，一個目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，但是不用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為按照你的風格，應該會更早一點就出現在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"或者直接闖進來，而不是呆站在那裡，像個等待答案的學生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我可以考慮接受你這樣一位學生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"給你一些必要的指點，如果這是你的目的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確需要你給我一個答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那張紙條，除了你沒有人能做出這種事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認識那個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"但我瞭解那個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"所以雖然我只是隨機在大街上給所有路過的孩子送上麵包，但我知道那張紙條一定會到你的手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問的是你為什麼要這麼做，而不是怎麼做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得自己很聰明？去跟蹤並利用一個孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......配合一下你的行動而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，懾砂先生在薩爾貢如此地小心謹慎，一定是不希望被某些人或者勢力找到吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼越是沒有痕跡的行動，越是不容易被發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能好好說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道是在說我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個自稱來自哥倫比亞的商人，自稱拿著那家公司的實驗武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我會相信這麼巧合的事情嗎？你這一次的目的又是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"那這麼多年你有真的查到什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做這樣的事情，已經不是第一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很享受這樣的感覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送上一份情報，看著我在你的引誘下，一次次忙得四處亂轉，最後落得一場空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"但你一定會追查下去的，因為復仇是永遠的母題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"而你又會做到哪一步呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我希望你不要誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想幫你，也是在幫我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"你有答應他的合作請求嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我告訴他我沒有興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒絕了他的合作請求，並告訴他永遠不要來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"真是出人意料的結果，我還以為你會欣然接受這份禮物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不信任他的身份，還是在懷疑我的目的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以給我什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以接受一切合理的價格，甚至......有趣的條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，不過我不會給你更多的條件，因為你已經開出了自己的價格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要一個目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接受你的開價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"成交。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你現在可以告訴我你知道的情報了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"他不是一個商人，那個人所聲稱的一切，不過是極其低劣的謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然能看出來，所以他才顯得非常可疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你既然知道，還讓他來找我，那一定是有特別的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那個人給我看了一支武器的樣品，來自哥倫比亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"非常有趣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"這支樣品在源石技藝的驅動上，相比於現在黑市上的所有商品，都要更加簡單一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"實話說，那支樣品上所呈現的技術遠沒有你當初的研究那麼精妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"但不管怎麼說，有人在試圖撬動那把不應該被打開的鎖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些技術資料中的任意一頁，都不應該被再次翻開，更不應該流入到黑市上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這是一條有價值的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"也有可能是一個誘餌，一個陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那真的是恰到好處，他們知道我一定會上鉤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄長......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_srgmarket"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以問問你接下來準備怎麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"