","isRemote":false,"text":"大多數報廢的實驗品都是由我們運輸和銷毀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"這支樣品......是我無意間在廢品裡發現的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗廢品？那你手上還有多少支這樣的武器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有了！只有這一支！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛可不是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我只是在騙他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"但我絕對沒有騙你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"生產出來的成品就不多......大部分都已經完全報廢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想著這些人就算收不到貨也不可能追到哥倫比亞找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾年前，你們公司拖了我一批貨物，當時和我說是實驗室發生了事故無法交付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有這麼一回事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"幾年前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"是，當時確實有一個實驗室發生了嚴重的事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"但是具體原因我就不知道了......我們也是在事故發生以後才趕到的現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有在現場看到不正常的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不尋常......應該沒有吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不過當時所有的殘骸和廢棄物，在被收集完成以後，都由公司單獨封存帶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"單獨封存？那最後送到什麼地方去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"真的！我真的不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"那時所有人在離開現場的時候還都被搜身檢查，防止任何東西被帶出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的真的是實話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"求求你，不要殺我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是出於良心不安而救人，還是為了有價值的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼不好意思的，我們不會無目的地去做任何事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是結果往往難以盡如人意，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以這就是你的目的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"享受看到我失落，無助，憤怒的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想知道一個答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟能為復仇做到哪一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以做任何事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗室裡的研究員呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗室裡的研究員，事故以後還有倖存者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"都已經死了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼吸沉重）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那屍體應該是你們處理的吧，後來被運到了什麼地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我聽很多研究員的家屬說，他們從來沒有真正見過自己親人的屍體，只是被告知他們的親人在這場事故裡死亡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"屍體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼吸沉重）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，屍體！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"都送去垃圾場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論嘗試多少次，到頭來都是一樣的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我盡力了，雖然總是失敗。但是我會做任何事情，總會心安理得一點。是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說夠了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有陰謀，沒有暗算，沒有陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許那些人根本不在意你的調查，甚至......早就把你遺忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"毫無價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想要我做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟可以為復仇做到哪一步？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！扔到垃圾場......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"因為不管殘缺的還是完整的，都只是一些......上面也沒有過問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也就按照常規遺棄處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"求求你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"求求你不要殺我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道不是他的錯，他只是個小人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但哪怕只是一點點的關聯，一點點微小的價值，你都不願意再放過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要能達到你的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"復仇是永遠的母題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是像你一樣嗎？放火燒掉整個城鎮，不顧任何牽連其中的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我給了他們疏散的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你只是在那一刻做了一個相對正確的選擇，讓你自己看起來沒有那麼難堪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我完成了復仇，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在追求一個真相，一個答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會一直追尋下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我和你的選擇......不會一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達雷爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"avg_379_sesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_472_pasngr","aliases":["異客"]}]}
